* SETTINGS

** Document Options
#+LATEX_CLASS_OPTIONS: [12pt,a4paper,twoside]
#+LATEX_HEADER: \setlength{\parindent}{1.5em}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \onehalfspacing

#+LATEX_HEADER: \pretitle{\begin{center}\scshape\LARGE\bfseries}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \posttitle{\par\end{center}\vskip 0.5em}

# #+LATEX_HEADER: \renewcommand\Authfont{\scshape}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \renewcommand\Affilfont{\footnotesize}
# #+LATEX_HEADER: \setlength{\affilsep}{1em}

#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\authmail}{[Missing Auth Mail]}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\setauthmail}[1]{\renewcommand{\authmail}{#1}}

** Header and Footer Configuration
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\docid}{[Missing Document ID]}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\setdocid}[1]{\renewcommand{\docid}{#1}}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\shorttitle}{[Missing Short Title]}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\setshorttitle}[1]{\renewcommand{\shorttitle}{#1}}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\shortauth}{[Missing Short Authors]}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newcommand{\setshortauth}[1]{\renewcommand{\shortauth}{#1}}

#+LATEX_HEADER: \pagestyle{fancy}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \fancyhf{}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \renewcommand{\headrulewidth}{0pt}

# Even pages
#+LATEX_HEADER: \fancyhead[LE]{\footnotesize\scshape \shorttitle}
# Odd pages
#+LATEX_HEADER: \fancyhead[LO]{\footnotesize\scshape \shortauth}
# Right side of all
#+LATEX_HEADER: \fancyhead[RE,RO]{\footnotesize\scshape\texttt{\textls[50]{\textcolor{black!80}{\docid}}}}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \fancyfoot[C]{\thepage}

# --- PLAIN STYLE OVERRIDE---
# #+LATEX_HEADER: \fancypagestyle{plain}{
# #+LATEX_HEADER:     \fancyhf{}
# #+LATEX_HEADER:     \fancyfoot[C]{\myfooter}
# #+LATEX_HEADER: }

** Section Title Formatting
#+LATEX_HEADER: \titleformat{\section}{\Large\bfseries}{\thesection}{1em}{}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \titleformat{\subsection}{\large\bfseries}{\thesubsection}{1em}{}

** Theorem Style
#+LATEX_HEADER: \theoremstyle{plain}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newtheorem{theorem}{Theorem}[section]
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newtheorem{lemma}{Lemma}[theorem]
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newtheorem{corollary}{Corollary}[theorem]
#+LATEX_HEADER: \theoremstyle{definition}
#+LATEX_HEADER: \newtheorem{definition}{Definition}[section]

